The sum-of-cubes <polynomial factorization> is
$$
\boxed{a^3+b^3=(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2).}
$$
Multiplication cancels the two mixed cubic terms and leaves precisely the two cubes.

= b
{parent=1}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=b}

The <polynomial> factors as
$$
x^3+x^2-16x+20=(x-2)^2(x+5).
$$
Thus the repeated <polynomial root> is **$x=2$**, of multiplicity two. Its repetition can also be checked from $p(2)=p'(2)=0$ and $p''(2)=14\ne0$.

